 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=64aFovkR8EYQ7kNvwEPlls2&_nc_oc=AdqwbBpWA8QJLo4KGHWfL-Gfynli8Ctq1zeNrTd8dVOfTJ0OoyZvRKc2EPzjMUsIF1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG79Cmbgftwlro2xGY2QpFdMhG_AXhQiICCqZnkXwmh9Q&oe=6A95E39E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d5NhLTVtvigQ7kNvwHw0cgL&_nc_oc=AdrPAQb6VRtiihxlZMFJD9rRLgrKzz5Yoi99DShUjJhXw60aRSOvCK5qljrbNKIJ7MQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGMKHJiZ0es6mjKf5cDnXsTeoszSfVDJLjH8z87ynjz3Q&oe=6A95C901"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k_pDb_BYsiQQ7kNvwGIl-aA&_nc_oc=Adr-UjMKigfRZb7Oaj3XE1opkBchYl_OZmW-oD-A1ENxuS04PAGrDbRlObRDQ9EvHvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFsikqFKxrBD4NyWMNCNg9d1UUIeBLRcEBGfftu2G7W_Q&oe=6A95DDFE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOW3x8bhVesQ7kNvwGI2_NI&_nc_oc=AdoPCLORtCFjcy1PvD26oHO2EiBCE50FPEz4WY3fGQwc8tGLbCHGv4z1am_27SejVhM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFkrM1WzKRJjsQiqxGLq2yfL90q_GiqiR4qsH0Xmv6MzQ&oe=6A95E223"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HU2MhmRt4LsQ7kNvwF-qqUd&_nc_oc=AdqNU6Rok8laL0jbcjQyQ8WJiYpDbY7CP7ptI7hsMiqj1Z4ZQF558XOvqhuGyRe-aZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGPHST-e5Auz8UrKSYiDXtRcqQ5jQWTBjOJbOh94MCJFA&oe=6A95AFFB"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con